# Working files that live inside `site/` but must not be PUBLISHED.
#
# Measured before the first deploy of 2026-07-30: 1,075 such files, 348 MB —
# 42% of the folder's weight — including 137 `nav.json.*` backups and
# `nav.json.damaged_by_cminsweep`, the file a read-only probe destroyed twice.
# They are kept on disk deliberately (they are how nav.json was recovered), but
# publishing them wastes upload, doubles the file count and puts this project's
# scratch history on the open web.
#
# Wrangler reads this from the directory being deployed.
*.bak
*.bak*
*.pre*
*.tmp
*damaged*
*.prepage
*.preadj
*.previnaya
*.preshape
*.preana
